7. The v2.1.0 core was adapted from the authorized Celestar Mod Menu source.
8. Credit for the original Celestar source is retained in CREDITS.md.
9. Authorization to adapt the source is acknowledged by the project maintainer.

10. Personal use
11. Personal use, testing, local modification, and study are permitted for the project as distributed.

12. Modification
13. You may modify your local copy for personal use.
14. Do not remove required attribution from source or documentation.

15. Redistribution
16. Redistribution of modified copies should preserve this license and CREDITS.md.
17. Do not claim original authorship of third-party source or assets.

18. Commercial use
19. Commercial redistribution requires separate permission from the relevant rights holders.

